# Build artifacts
*.jar
*.class

# Local working notes (CLAUDE.md, fix_report.md, update_features.md, todo.txt)
*.md
!README.md
*.txt
# ...but the terrain maps are game data the build needs, not notes. Without
# these a fresh clone falls back to Terrain's procedural walls and the stage
# lengths and boss timings no longer line up with the level.
!src/maps/*.txt

